# Logistics — local development

**Inherits:** monorepo root `.cursor/rules/`. Port **3205** — `npm run dev`.

Prisma: `prisma/schema.prisma`. **Env:** standard satellite vars (`ERA_SATELLITE_ORGANIZATION_ID`, `ORCHESTRATOR_URL`, `SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN`, …).

